Template: channelview/admin_user
Type: string
Default: admin
Description: User name of the ChannelView administrator:
 ChannelView asks everybody to sign in. Choose the user name of the first
 account: an administrator who can edit the dashboard and manage the other
 accounts (later: sudo channelview-user, or the account menu in the page).

Template: channelview/admin_password
Type: password
Description: Password of the ChannelView administrator:
 At least 10 characters. If you leave this empty, a random password is made. It
 is shown at the end of the installation when you install from a terminal, and
 kept, readable by root only, in /var/lib/channelview/initial-admin-password
 until you have chosen your own at the first sign-in.

Template: channelview/admin_password_again
Type: password
Description: Repeat the password:
 Type the same password again.

Template: channelview/password_problem
Type: error
Description: The passwords differ or are too short
 The two entries must be the same and have at least 10 characters. Try again,
 or leave the password empty to get a random one.
